For refusal it is larger with Claude's rewrites than with GPT's shorter ones in every model (\llama $-14.3$ vs.\ $-4.3$\pp; \qwen $-12.7$ vs.\ $-4.3$; \gpt $-7.9$ vs.\ $-4.9$; \claude $-5.6$ vs.\ $-2.6$; \gemini $-4.7$ vs.\ $-0.7$).
